# MESSAGES.md template (design 5.9, N4)
#
# Append-only durable record of urgent cross-session calls (design: "Urgent
# calls only ... the durable record of the message channel"). The live
# messaging happens over the harness's own session-to-session messaging
# facility; this file is the fallback where a session cannot be messaged,
# and the record either way. Not a chat log — only urgent calls ("hold
# pushes", "integration red") belong here (design Round 9: "Everything else
# is ledger — messages are for urgent calls only").
#
# Format:
#
#   <ISO8601> from=<session-id> to=<session-id-or-ALL> :: <message text>
#
# Example lines (illustration only):
# 2026-09-25T09:10:00Z from=squad-security to=ALL :: hold pushes -- integration branch red on the go tier, fix in flight
# 2026-09-25T09:18:00Z from=squad-security to=ALL :: integration branch green again, hold released
